Step 7: Create the central Sales Fact Table
This is the most important table in our Star Schema.
CREATE TABLE fact_sales (
    sales_id INT,
    date_id INT,
    product_id INT,
    customer_id INT,
    store_id INT,
    quantity INT,
    unit_price DOUBLE,
    discount DOUBLE,
    total_amount DOUBLE
)
STORED AS ORC;


Explanation:
Column	Description
sales_id	Unique sales transaction line ID
date_id	References dim_date
product_id	References dim_product
customer_id	References dim_customer
store_id	References dim_store
quantity	Number of units purchased
unit_price	Actual unit selling price
discount	Total discount for the line
total_amount	Net sales amount

The calculation is:
\[
\text{Total Amount} =
(\text{Quantity}\times\text{Unit Price})-\text{Discount}
\]

